"""WS2815C-2020-4P - 12 V addressable RGB LED, single-wire data, 2.2 x 2.0 mm SMD-4P.

Datasheet: Worldsemi WS2815C-2020-4P V1.0 (2023-07-20), LCSC C22371529
("WS-DS").

Supply: VDD +9.5 to +13.5 V (WS-DS p.3, maximum ratings table, "电源电压");
the electrical and switching tables are given at VDD = 12 V and the typical
application (p.5) runs from 12 V. The R/G/B chips are driven by constant-current
outputs from VDD, so the part needs that supply range to light. VDD is declared
with that range, so a lower rail raises a build warning.

Data (WS-DS p.3, at VDD = 12 V): DI VIH 2.7 V min, VIL 1.5 V max, input range
-0.3 to 5.7 V (VI), input capacitance 15 pF max; DI to DO delay 300 ns max.
Bit timing (p.4): T0H 220-380 ns, T1H 580-840 ns, T0L 900-5000 ns,
T1L 600-5000 ns, reset (RES) low >= 280 us, bit period >= 1.25 us; 24 bits per
LED, GRB order, MSB first. DO re-shapes and forwards the data to the next LED's
DI.

External parts: none, capacitors included (p.1, features: "外围不需要包含电容在内的
所有任何电子元器件").

Pins (p.2, "引脚功能"): 1 DO, 2 GND, 3 DI, 4 VDD. Footprint (LCSC/EasyEDA,
Altium MicrasLib): pad 1 (-0.865, -0.55), 2 (-0.865, +0.55), 3 (+0.865, +0.55),
4 (+0.865, -0.55), 0.8 x 0.8 mm: the p.2 top view turned 180 degrees, same
winding, not mirrored. The p.2 "PCB Solder Pad" drawing gives 0.7 x 0.7 mm pads,
1.13 mm apart across the body (pad centres +/-0.915 mm) and 0.40 mm apart
along it (+/-0.55 mm). Moisture sensitivity level 5a (p.6).
"""

VDD = io(Power(voltage="9.5V to 13.5V"))
GND = io(Ground)
DI = io(Net)
DO = io(Net)

Component(
    name="LED",
    prefix="D",
    symbol=Symbol(library="WS2815C-2020.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("LED-SMD_4P-L2.2-W2.0-P1.00_WS2815C-2020-4P.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="WS2815C-2020-4P", manufacturer="Worldsemi"),
    pins={
        "DO": DO,
        "GND": GND,
        "DI": DI,
        "VDD": VDD,
    },
)
